      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digbeth"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Sunday Times dubbed Digbeth the 'Coolest Neighbourhood in Britain,' celebrating its independent bars, street art, and quirky shops.",
